OL,3,AUK-France 'one in, one out' migrant
OL,4,Ascheme scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government has announced the
OL,7,F"one in, one out" agreement with France
OL,8,Fto send back some migrants who cross
OL,9,Fthe Channel has been scrapped.
OL,11,FThe pilot scheme allowed the UK to
OL,12,Freturn some small boat arrivals while
OL,13,Fagreeing to take in the same number of
OL,14,Fpeople from France who were believed to
OL,15,Fhave a legitimate claim to come to
OL,16,FBritain.
OL,18,FOnly around 1,500 people have been
OL,19,Fremoved to France since the scheme
OL,20,Fbegan just over a year ago.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
