OL,3,AUK-France 'one in, one out' migrant
OL,4,Ascheme scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands the government
OL,7,Fwould have liked the scheme to
OL,8,Fcontinue, but felt it did not reach the
OL,9,Fdesired scale.
